## Modified Files

### [game_engine.dart](file:///c:/Users/vivek/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aqua-sort-flutter/lib/features/game/engine/game_engine.dart)
- Added `canFreeUndo`, `needsPaidUndo`, `freeUndosLeft` getters
- Added `withBonusTime()` and `withBonusMoves()` factory helpers for loss recovery

### [game_provider.dart](file:///c:/Users/vivek/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aqua-sort-flutter/lib/features/game/providers/game_provider.dart)
- Split `undo()` into private `_performUndo()` + public `requestUndo()` with gating
- `requestUndo()` flow: free → premium check → bottom sheet (coins/ad/premium)
- Added `grantBonusTime()`, `grantBonusMoves()`, `rewardAdCoins()` methods

### [board_widget.dart](file:///c:/Users/vivek/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aqua-sort-flutter/lib/features/game/widgets/board_widget.dart)
- Replaced old "Moves" / "Time" pills with purpose-built HUD:
  - **⏱️ Timer pill** — countdown with color warnings (amber < 30s, red < 10s)
  - **🎯 Moves pill** — moves left with color warnings (amber < 10, red < 5)
  - **🔄 Undo button** — badge showing free undos remaining (green/amber/red/lock)

### [game_screen.dart](file:///c:/Users/vivek/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/aqua-sort-flutter/lib/features/game/screens/game_screen.dart)
- Added lost-state listener to trigger game-over overlay
- Added `_buildGameOverOverlay()` with "Time's Up!" / "No Moves Left!" messaging
- Recovery options: Watch Ad (+30s or +5 moves), Retry, Go Home

## Economy Balance (Final)

| Action | Coins |
|--------|-------|
| Complete level (base) | **+30** |
| Extra undo (beyond 2 free) | **-30** |
| Watch ad | **+15** |
| 2 ads ≈ 1 paid undo | ✅ balanced |

